{"text":"Now, I would like to make it clear in parenthesis that I do not blame my parents for their point of view. There is an expiry date on blaming your parents for steering you in the wrong direction. The moment you are old enough to take the wheel, responsibility lies with you. What is more, I cannot criticise my parents for hoping that I would never experience poverty. They had been poor themselves, and I have since been poor. And I quite agree with them that it is not an ennobling experience. Poverty entails fear and stress, and sometimes depression. It means a thousand petty humiliations and hardships. Climbing out of poverty by your own efforts, that is something on which to pride yourself. But poverty itself is romanticised only by fools.","words":[{"text":"Now","start":0.0,"end":0.54,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":0.62,"end":0.96},{"text":"would","start":0.96,"end":1.16},{"text":"like","start":1.16,"end":1.4},{"text":"to","start":1.4,"end":1.56},{"text":"make","start":1.56,"end":1.68},{"text":"it","start":1.68,"end":1.84},{"text":"clear","start":1.84,"end":2.08},{"text":"in","start":2.08,"end":2.32},{"text":"parenthesis","start":2.32,"end":2.98},{"text":"that","start":2.98,"end":3.68},{"text":"I","start":3.68,"end":3.84},{"text":"do","start":3.84,"end":4.04},{"text":"not","start":4.04,"end":4.24},{"text":"blame","start":4.24,"end":4.48},{"text":"my","start":4.48,"end":4.7},{"text":"parents","start":4.7,"end":5.04},{"text":"for","start":5.04,"end":5.28},{"text":"their","start":5.28,"end":5.44},{"text":"point","start":5.44,"end":5.64},{"text":"of","start":5.64,"end":5.84},{"text":"view","start":5.84,"end":6.12,"punct":"."},{"text":"There","start":6.64,"end":6.92},{"text":"is","start":6.92,"end":7.08},{"text":"an","start":7.08,"end":7.24},{"text":"expiry","start":7.24,"end":7.82},{"text":"date","start":7.82,"end":8.2},{"text":"on","start":8.2,"end":8.54},{"text":"blaming","start":8.54,"end":8.84},{"text":"your","start":8.84,"end":9.12},{"text":"parents","st